/target
**/*.rs.bk

# `mobiler upgrade` review sidecars and `--apply` backups. Commit the rest of `.mobiler/` — the version stamp and the
# `.mobiler/base/` template snapshot are the 3-way-merge ancestor `upgrade` needs (and they let
# collaborators upgrade cleanly too).
*.mobiler-new
*.mobiler-bak
.mobiler/backup/
.mobiler/new/

